  digest=b3:72857ac76e3b2ce92f8d9efc6fe57fb2fbf29931b6c3b9a75a6098ca81c2a44c file=construct/backchannel/backchannel.go range=28:73 lang=go exported=true byte_range=1259:3302
  sig=func ValidateResponse(ask *primitives.Ask, resp *primitives.AskResponse) error
  doc=ValidateResponse checks a posted AskResponse against the Ask it answers, per\nthe Ask kind's expected-response contract. It is the trust gate the receiver\nruns BEFORE delivering the answer to the parked agent: a malformed or\noff-contract response is rejected (the run stays parked) rather than feeding\nthe agent garbage. A nil/unknown ask or response is an error.
